  "text": "Shionogi Inc. - A Discovery-Based Pharmaceutical Company About About Philosophy Culture Transparency Leadership Team Partners History and Global Brand Sustainability Innovation Innovation Pipeline Fragile X Syndrome Clinical Trials Clinical Trial Data Privacy Policy Medical Information Early Access Policy Investigator Research Rare Disease Patient Advocacy ALS Funding Requests News News News Posts Social Media Community Guidelines Products Investors Careers Contact United States Worldwide Building on Our Scientific Legacy To Deliver Firsts for Patients We are committed to identifying unmet needs and harnessing the full potential of science to treat challenging human diseases. Meet Shionogi Since 1878, we have been committed to our mission of developing new treatments to help improve the lives of patients worldwide. We are working to address global health challenges such as antimicrobial resistance and COVID-19. Learn More About Us Committed to Scientific Excellence Since 1959, we have been committed to discovering and introducing novel antibiotics. But today, our R&D story goes beyond antibiotics to include novel medications for HIV and influenza and clinical programs for COVID-19 and other diseases with high unmet needs. Learn More about Our Science Join Our Team We are driven to impact patient lives and bring better solutions to the communities we serve. We are bold, curious, and excited by the opportunity to be part of something big. If that sounds like you, Shionogi may be the place where you can make your mark. Discover Our Career Opportunities Meet Our People At Shionogi, we're always in search of better solutions. Meet a few of our team members and discover why they enjoy working at Shionogi. Meet Our People Partnering to Bring Meaningful Science to Patients We build partnerships with industry, government agencies and early-stage biotechs that are focused on advancing science with the urgency that today's global health challenges demand. Partner with Us About Sustainability Innovation Products Investors News Careers Contact Worldwide Privacy Policy Terms of Use Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy © 2026 Shionogi Inc. Florham Park, NJ 07932. All Rights Reserved.",
